    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσ-θετέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be dissatisfied</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς συνθήκαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					128
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be in distress</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.113
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly in 
				Med.
			, abs., <i>to be vexed</i>, <i><span class="en">
