				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.2.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					33.17.1
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be in straits</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				8.5.4
			</span></i>.</div>
